{"id":"3c8230787b91c51f","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-mm-unification-correctness.md","title":"合一算法的成功与失败判据","display":"thm-mm-unification-correctness — 合一算法的成功与失败判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness","aliases":["56-thm-mm-unification-correctness"],"display":"thm-mm-unification-correctness — 合一算法的成功与失败判据","depends_on":["[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]","[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","[[56-thm-mm-unification-termination]]","[[56-thm-mm-run-invariant]]","[[56-df-mgu]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Theorem 7.7.6 and proof","source_printed_pages":"293–294","source_ocr_blocks":[314,315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-mm-unification-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mm-unification-correctness — 合一算法的成功与失败判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc72c7a211eea473\" href=\"?note=bc72c7a211eea473\" title=\"56-thm-mm-unification-termination\">56-thm-mm-unification-termination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28729f9f64189602\" href=\"?note=28729f9f64189602\" title=\"56-thm-mm-run-invariant\">56-thm-mm-run-invariant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Theorem 7.7.6 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293–294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\\)</span>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)\">\\(a=\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\)</span>。运行、目标解集和幂等性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28729f9f64189602\" href=\"?note=28729f9f64189602\" title=\"56-thm-mm-run-invariant\">56-thm-mm-run-invariant</a> 及其运行接口，终止及末端分类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bc72c7a211eea473\" href=\"?note=bc72c7a211eea473\" title=\"56-thm-mm-unification-termination\">56-thm-mm-unification-termination</a>，二项MGU接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Failed}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Failed}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\iff\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E_0)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Successful}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E_0)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(\\{(s,t)\\})=\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(\\{(s,t)\\})=\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极大运行只终止于空目标或失败。若末端空，运行不变量给出Sol(E₀)={aρ:ρ∈S}，取ρ为恒等得到a自身是解，每个解又在整个V上经a因子化，故a为MGU，且已证幂等。若末端失败，Sol(E₀)=空。任意选择规则都无无限运行；原书定理7.7.6的正确性证明已读并按本地接口展开。这里给的是有限自由项的语法合一，未宣称解决非空等式理论上的E合一；如需实际实现，还须给函数符号和变量的可判等编码。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-mm-unification-run","status":"resolved","id":"38760d0fb2c20b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-idempotent-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"94e07ab4a04b0626","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-mm-unification-termination","status":"resolved","id":"bc72c7a211eea473","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-mm-unification-termination]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-mm-run-invariant","status":"resolved","id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-mm-run-invariant]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mgu","status":"resolved","id":"5252b28de1f68970","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-mgu]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-mm-run-invariant","status":"resolved","id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":""